    "callMonth": "2026-04",
    "page": 14,
    "speaker": "Meeting Audio",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "Of course, all of you know, and probably there will be questions around a lot of under recoveries there but gasoline at 6.5% growth, gasoil 3.6 and the petrochemical products also reasonably strong growth.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-01-1",
